  "description": "With the BACKROAD GRX RX810 you can blast down gravel or dirt roads with full control. The gravel bike is also great at higher speeds on asphalt. Equipped with the first-class SHIMANO GRX RX810 gravel groupset and a double drivetrain, this gravel bike is ideal for longer gravel tours that require smaller gear steps and a wider gear range. Thanks to robust ROSE R-THIRTY LIGHT Disc wheels encased in Continental all-round gravel tyres and with a traditional road handlebar, the BACKROAD can handle lots of kilometres – whether on asphalt, gravel or light trails. More long distance – Endurance Flex is fun – massive comfort in the saddle and a gravity-specific frame fork geometry offers perfect handling on road, gravel and technical terrain. Only a dry throat can stop you. More off-road – Action The frame and fork now allow for a tyre width of up to 45 mm with 700c and up to 47 mm with 650b wheels. For rougher road conditions, perfectly adapted protectors at the down tube and chainstays shield from stone chips. More experience – Adventure Moreover, the BACKROAD has several mounting points for bottle cages, AnythingCages or bags for the ultimate versatility.",
